            0.05       9.225e-03      1.051       +1.14    |  2.624e-05      0.000
            0.20       5.765e-04      0.995       +1.01    |  1.640e-06      0.001
            1.00       2.306e-05      0.991       +1.00    |  6.561e-08      0.228
            8.10       3.518e-07      0.991       +1.00    |  1.001e-09      0.941
           50.00       9.225e-09      0.991       +1.00    |  2.624e-11      0.965
  [PASS] V3 [THE CMB GATE] at the ultraviolet reach the forest demands, the self-critical sector restores the third acoustic peak to within 5% of the cold-dark-matter value: the same single number that makes the sector cold enough for the Lyman-alpha forest makes it cold enough for the CMB, with no further freedom
           (k_max = 8.10 /Mpc gives c_s^2(z=1100) = 3.52e-07, peak3/peak2 = 0.991 vs LCDM 0.992 (restoration +1.00); smooth-fluid control 0.575)
  [PASS] V4 [which gate binds, computed] the CMB is satisfied over the whole scanned range of ultraviolet reach while the forest is not: the forest, not the CMB, is what sets the bound on how far the instability must reach, and the two are not in competition
           (CMB restored (> 0.9) for k_max >= 0.05 /Mpc; forest within 10% for k_max >= 8.10 /Mpc)
  [PASS] V5 [the forest at its own epoch] with the sound speed the law gives at z = 3 rather than the recombination value held constant, the forest-critical reach leaves the linear power at k = 5 h/Mpc within 10% of LCDM, so one ultraviolet reach clears both gates instead of trading one against the other
           (c_s^2(z=3) = 1.00e-09 at k_max = 8.10 /Mpc gives P(k=5 h/Mpc, z=3)/LCDM = 0.941)
    LIMITS: the Boltzmann code takes a CONSTANT sound speed, so each gate is run with the value the law gives at that gate's own epoch; the sector's comoving Jeans
    scale is k_max at every epoch (V1), which is what makes that split legitimate, but a code carrying the full c_s^2(z) = (H/k_max)^2 history would settle it properly;
    the sector is modelled as a w = -1e-4 perfect fluid, which is what criticality makes it, but its
    background density is imposed as the LCDM cold-matter share rather than derived; no kernel is active; the criticality must operate at recombination, i.e. the clock
    must run faster than proper time there, which is a condition on the coefficient history and is NOT established by this script.

